# Goal: spawn this many turtles and hunt every one of them down.
int32 turtle_count
---
# Result: how the whole mission went.
int32 total_caught
float64 elapsed_seconds
---
# Feedback: live progress, streamed on every control tick while the hunt runs.
int32 caught_so_far
int32 remaining
string current_target
float64 distance_to_target
